@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #456078
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title AoT：从本轮调度到可消费的结果
participant "vLLM\n调度/结果处理" as s
participant "QAIC\nWorker / Runner" as r
participant "QaicCausalLM" as m
participant "QAICInferenceSession" as ses
participant "qaicrt" as rt
s -> r : SchedulerOutput
r -> r : 更新请求状态与 KV 槽位\n准备 token、position、batch_index
r -> m : prefill / decode 输入
m -> m : 按编译规格分块、补齐
m -> ses : np_run(inputs)
ses -> rt : ExecObj.setData\nQueue.enqueue
ses --> m : 执行对象索引
m --> r : 保留执行状态
note over r,rt #FFF0D9
提交不等于完成：NumPy 缓冲区须存活到等待结束
end note
r -> ses : complete_inf(index)\n同步路径或延后至结果处理
ses -> rt : waitForCompletion
rt --> ses : 完成 / 错误
ses --> r : 可消费结果
r -> r : logits 处理与采样\n或处理设备采样输出
r --> s : 本轮结果
@enduml
